{
  "_comment": [
    "v1.4.15-pre7 主进程类型检查。",
    "tsconfig.json 的 include 只有 [src, src/types]，electron/ 从未被类型检查过；",
    "esbuild 转译不做类型检查，eslint 不查类型，于是形成三重掩盖——",
    "v1.4.14-pre9 曾因此把 OTA 检查与下载全弄断而 tsc/vitest/eslint 三项全绿。",
    "本文件只补类型检查，不参与构建（noEmit），也不改变 tsconfig.json。"
  ],
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2022",
    "lib": [
      "ES2022",
      "DOM"
    ],
    "module": "ESNext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "strict": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "allowImportingTsExtensions": true,
    "baseUrl": ".",
    "paths": {
      "@/*": [
        "src/*"
      ]
    },
    "types": [
      "node"
    ]
  },
  "include": [
    "electron/**/*.ts"
  ]
}